      "Bash(git commit -m \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\nfeat: Complete LOGOS Spectacular frontend with all fixes and improvements\n\n## Major Fixes Applied:\n\n### Component Export/Import Fixes\n- Fixed NarrativeTimeline, MultiScaleView, ComparativeFrames export mismatches\n- Added named exports alongside default exports for all innovation components\n- Fixed page export patterns \\(removed invalid export const from pages\\)\n\n### Icon Library Fixes\n- Replaced non-existent lucide-react icons \\(Magic→Wand2, Compare→ArrowLeftRight\\)\n- Fixed CheckCircle→CheckCircle2 in translation/export\n- Updated all generated components to use lucide-react instead of react-icons\n\n### TypeScript Type Safety\n- Extended component props interfaces for flexible usage across pages\n- Fixed useState type inference issues with d3 scales and objects\n- Added proper null checks for SSR compatibility\n- Fixed Set iteration with Array.from\\(\\) for TypeScript compatibility\n- Added THREE imports to all 3D visualization components\n\n### SSR/Prerendering Fixes\n- Fixed window.innerWidth/Height access in stylometry page\n- Added optional chaining for data.thesis, data.abstract, data.sections\n- Removed motion.mesh usage \\(framer-motion doesn''t support Three.js\\)\n\n### 3D Visualization Improvements\n- Fixed d3-force-3d integration with proper type declarations\n- Updated Three.js line rendering for React-Three-Fiber compatibility\n- Added proper type extensions for d3 simulation nodes\n\n### Generated Components Updated\n- helppanel.tsx: Converted to lucide-react\n- searchinterface.tsx: Converted to lucide-react\n- parameterdisplay.tsx: Removed react-tooltip, converted to lucide-react\n\n## Build Status\n✅ TypeScript compilation: PASSED\n✅ All 48 pages generated successfully\n✅ No type errors\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code]\\(https://claude.com/claude-code\\)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n\\)\")",
